<title>EGYPT: EGYPT OFFERS 91-DAY T-BILLS WORTH 700 MILLION.</title>
<headline>EGYPT OFFERS 91-DAY T-BILLS WORTH 700 MILLION.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 91-day treasury bills worth 700 million pounds for auction on August 13 and issue on August 14 when 91-day bills worth 973.250 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 8.800 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
